  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.753,
            0.048,
            0.86,
            0.066
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Algebra Play"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.089,
            0.342,
            0.108
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Add 6: 5M + 6"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.113,
            0.436,
            0.133
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Multiply by 4: 20M + 24"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.137,
            0.364,
            0.156
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Add 9: 20M + 33"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.162,
            0.458,
            0.181
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Multiply by 5: 100M + 165"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.185,
            0.482,
            0.205
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Add the day: 100M + 165 + D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.21,
            0.399,
            0.228
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Mukta’s answer was 291."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.233,
            0.413,
            0.252
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• 291 = 100M + 165 + D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.258,
            0.411,
            0.276
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• 291 – 165 = 100M + D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.281,
            0.358,
            0.299
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "126 = 100M + D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.3,
            0.847,
            0.357
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Since D is a day within a month, it is atmost 31 and requires only 2 digits. So the last 2 digits are D and what comes before that is M. In this case, M is 1 and D is 26, i.e., the 26th of January."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.367,
            0.846,
            0.405
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Mukta thinks of another date, follows the same steps, and reports her answer as 1390. What date did Mukta start with this time?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.414,
            0.593,
            0.435
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• Subtracting 165 from 1390, we get 1225."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.439,
            0.784,
            0.459
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• This means that the date she thought of was 25th December."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.468,
            0.662,
            0.491
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Find the dates if the final answers are the following:"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.169,
            0.498,
            0.257,
            0.518
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) 1269"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.163,
            0.523,
            0.247,
            0.542
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) 394"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.157,
            0.546,
            0.246,
            0.566
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) 296"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.571,
            0.846,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You can try this trick with your friends. Ask them to choose the starting date as their birthday."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.619,
            0.801,
            0.677
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ Can you change the steps in this trick and still find the original date? Instead of subtracting 165 from the final answer, you might have to subtract some other number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.816,
            0.611,
            0.903,
            0.67
          ],
          "content": [
